## Context

Audit of test_validate.sh and test_check.sh against validate.go's 13 rules
surfaced several code branches with zero negative tests.

## Actions

Add fixtures covering: missing/wrong magic line, missing required headers,
singleton-header repetition, Closed: empty value and misplaced in log/body,
filename pattern violations, separator missing/duplicate, malformed log lines,
unknown headers, Tags negative case, Blocked-by to unknown ID, kitchen-sink
positive ticket, and self-reference/length-3 dependency cycles in check.

